<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:mda="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:metadata:2.0" version="2.0" srcLang="en" trgLang="uk">
  <file id="dialogs\support\cc_dave.txt" original="dialogs\support\cc_dave.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Hey, if you're looking for the guy in a black and red cloak, he left. He looked like an action figure.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гей, якщо ти шукаєш хлопця в чорному та червоному плащі, він пішов. Він виглядав як екшн-фігурка.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Hi. Welcome to Dominating Bar.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Привіт. Ласкаво просимо до "Домінуючого Бару".&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I'm Dave Strelnik, the owner of this dominating establishment. What can I getcha?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я Дейв Стрельник, власник цього домінуючого закладу. Що вам піднести?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Yeah, we've got loads of happy customers. All the time.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Так, у нас багато задоволених клієнтів. Постійно.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Yeah, we're small now, but given enough time we'll become the most dominating bar in the city!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Так, ми зараз маленькі, але з часом ми станемо найдомінуючішим баром у місті!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Hey, neighbor. Gotta tell ya, that mansion of yours sure is dominating.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гей, сусіде. Мушу сказати, твій маєток справді домінуючий.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Someone hacked a JKK's ad terminal and played some strange stuff. I think Free Drones are behind that.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Хтось зламав рекламний термінал JKK і запустив дивні речі. Думаю, за цим стоять Вільні Дрони.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Care for a drink? Two? Three?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Хочете випити? Два? Три?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I heard Praetorians made a big push and cleared the blockade.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я чув, що преторіанці здійснили великий прорив і розблокували перешкоди.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Don't worry about the Faceless. Have a drink!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не хвилюйтеся про Безликих. Випийте!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Heard about Edmund Knight? Damn...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чули про Едмунда Найта? Чорт...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>This is a good location for a bar; Hardcore City Bar is too far from residential.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Це хороше місце для бару; "Hardcore City Bar" занадто далеко від житлових районів.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>What's up with those Tchortists anyway? Weirdos.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Що там з тими Тчортистами? Диваки.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q15" name="=&gt;q15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>How was your day?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Як твій день?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q16" name="=&gt;q16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>That guy looks like an action figure.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Цей хлопець виглядає як екшн-фігурка.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
  </file>
